
# AI Study Assistant

## Project Overview
AI Study Assistant is a beginner-friendly Python project powered by Google Gemini AI. It helps students learn topics and prepare for exams.

## Features
1. Explain a Topic
2. Summarise Text
3. Generate Practice Questions
4. Get Study Tips

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Google Gemini AI
- Google Gen AI SDK

## Installation

Install the required library:

pip install google-genai

## API Key Setup
Set your Gemini API key as an environment variable named GEMINI_API_KEY.

Do not upload your API key to GitHub.

## How to Run

Run the following command:

python AI_Study_Assistant.py

## Project Objective
To explore how Artificial Intelligence can support students in their learning process.
